    <table class="body" style="Margin:0;background:#fefefe;border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;height:100%;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%">
      <tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">
        <td class="center" align="center" valign="top" style="-moz-hyphens:auto;-webkit-hyphens:auto;Margin:0;border-collapse:collapse!important;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:auto;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word">
          <center data-parsed="" style="min-width:0!important;width:100%">
            
            <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" class="container float-center" style="Margin:0 auto;background:#fefefe;border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;float:none;margin:0 auto;padding:0;text-align:center;vertical-align:top;width:670px"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><td style="-moz-hyphens:auto;-webkit-hyphens:auto;Margin:0;border-collapse:collapse!important;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:auto;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word"><!-- START Header Modules --> <!-- START Preheader | Version 3.2 --><p class="text-center" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:15px;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;margin-bottom:15px;padding:0;text-align:center;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Bem-vindo às novas oportunidades de expandir seus negócios como um especialista em PC entusiasta. Estamos ansiosos para aprofundar nosso relacionamento profissional.<br><a href="http://app.plan.intel.com/e/es?s=~~eloqua..type--emailfield..syntax--siteid..encodeFor--url~~&amp;e=~~eloqua..type--emailfield..syntax--elqemailsaveguid..encodeFor--url~~" target="_blank" style="Margin:inherit;color:#00AEEF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:400;line-height:23.4px;margin:inherit;padding:0;text-align:left;text-decoration:none">Clique aqui para exibir este e-mail como uma página web.</a></p><!-- END Preheader | Version 3.2 --> <!-- START Header - Basic Image Bottom Text CTA | Version 3.2 --><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="row header" style="background-color:#0071c5;border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;display:table;padding:0;position:relative;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">
                    <th class="small-12 large-12 columns first last" style="Margin:0 auto;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:24.5px;margin:0 auto;padding:0;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:30px;padding-right:30px;padding-top:20px;text-align:left;width:640px"><table style="border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><th style="Margin:0;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left">
                        <div class="text-center">
                            <center data-parsed="" style="min-width:0!important;width:100%"><!-- START Logo Image --> <!-- START Intel Logo --> <span elqid="9078" elqtype="DynamicContent" class="remove-absolute" style="display: block"></span> <!-- END Intel Logo --> <!-- END Logo Image --> <!-- START Logo Bottom Spacer --><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="spacer float-center" style="Margin:0 auto;border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;float:none;margin:0 auto;padding:0;text-align:center;vertical-align:top;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><td height="20px" style="-moz-hyphens:auto;-webkit-hyphens:auto;Margin:0;border-collapse:collapse!important;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:400;hyphens:auto;line-height:20px;margin:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><!-- END Logo Bottom Spacer --></center>  
                        </div><!-- START Header Content --><h1 class="text-center" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:5px;color:#fefefe;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:32px;margin:0;margin-bottom:5px;padding:0;text-align:center;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Você se qualificou!</h1><!-- START Text CTA --><h3 class="text-center" style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:5px;color:#0071c5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:23.4px;margin:0;margin-bottom:5px;padding:0;text-align:center;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/br/pt/secure/technology-provider/enthusiast-qualified/qualified-enthusiast-pc-specialty-benefits.html" target="_blank" style="Margin:0;color:#8CDAFA;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:400;line-height:23.4px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;text-decoration:none">Acesse os benefícios &gt;</a></h3><!-- START Text CTA --> <!-- END Header Content --></th>
<th class="expander" style="Margin:0;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;padding:0!important;text-align:left;visibility:hidden;width:0"></th></tr></tbody></table></th>
                </tr></tbody></table><!-- START Header Image --> <img src="http://images.plan.intel.com/EloquaImages/clients/IntelCorporation/{4913b410-1328-4089-95a4-b0af78b55f99}_C-MKA-333_T-MKA-1698-hero-4.jpg" alt="" class="responsive" style="-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic;clear:both;display:block;max-width:100%;outline:0;text-decoration:none;width:auto"> <!-- END Header Image --> <!-- END Header - Basic: Image Bottom Text CTA | Version 3.2 --> <!-- START Spacer Module | Version 3.2 --><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="spacer" style="border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><td height="30px" style="-moz-hyphens:auto;-webkit-hyphens:auto;Margin:0;border-collapse:collapse!important;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:30px;font-weight:400;hyphens:auto;line-height:30px;margin:0;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table><!-- END Spacer Module --> <!-- END Header Modules --> <!-- START Body Modules --> <!-- START Content Full Width | Version 3.2 --><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="row body" style="Margin:0;background:#fefefe;border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;color:#959595;display:table;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;height:100%;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;padding:0;position:relative;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">
                    <th class="content no-padding-bottom small-12 large-12 columns first last" style="Margin:0 auto;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:24.5px;margin:0 auto;padding:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:30px;padding-right:30px;text-align:left;width:640px"><table style="border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><th style="Margin:0;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left"><!-- START Content --><h2 style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:5px;color:#0071c5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:23.4px;margin:0;margin-bottom:5px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none"><span class="eloquaemail">FirstName</span>,</h2>
                       
                        <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:15px;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;margin-bottom:15px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Parabéns por se tornar um especialista em PC entusiasta do programa Intel<sup>&reg;</sup> Technology Provider!<p>
                                <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:15px;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;margin-bottom:15px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Com mais de um bilhão de gamers de PC no mundo<sup>1</sup> e um mercado que cresce rapidamente, você estará bem posicionado para expandir sua base de clientes e aumentar a receita com a Intel.</p>
                                <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:15px;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;margin-bottom:15px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Aproveite todos os benefícios agora disponíveis para você, incluindo:</p>
                        
                        <ul>
                          <li>Promoções de pontos adicionais para produtos com os processadores Intel<sup>&reg;</sup> Core&trade; série X, K e H</li>
                          <li>Designação de Especialista em PC entusiasta e visibilidade na página da Web do programa Intel Technology Provider</li>
                          <li>Webinars técnicos realizados por especialistas da Intel</li>
                          <li>Pacotes de jogos e software de nível mundial</li>
                          <li>Credenciais para eventos locais de e-sports</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p style="-moz-hyphens:none;-ms-hyphens:none;-webkit-hyphens:none;Margin:0;Margin-bottom:15px;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:none;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;margin-bottom:15px;padding:0;text-align:left;word-break:keep-all;word-wrap:none">Agradecemos sua parceria com a Intel.</p><!-- START Button CTA --><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="button radius no-margin-bottom small-expanded" style="Margin:0 0 30px 0;border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;margin:0 0 30px 0;margin-bottom:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:auto"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top"><td style="-moz-hyphens:auto;-webkit-hyphens:auto;Margin:0;border-collapse:collapse!important;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:auto;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word"><table style="border-bottom:0;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:100%"><tbody><tr style="padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">
<td style="-moz-hyphens:auto;-webkit-hyphens:auto;Margin:0;background:#00AEEF;border:none;border-collapse:collapse!important;border-radius:3px;color:#fefefe;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;hyphens:auto;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;word-wrap:break-word"><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/br/pt/secure/technology-provider/enthusiast-qualified/qualified-enthusiast-pc-specialty-benefits.html" target="_blank" style="Margin:0;border:0 solid #00AEEF;border-radius:3px;color:#fefefe;display:inline-block;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:23.4px;margin:0;padding:8px 30px 8px 30px;text-align:left;text-decoration:none">Acesse as vantagens</a></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><!-- END Button CTA --> <!-- END Content --></th>
<th class="expander" style="Margin:0;color:#959595;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;line-height:24.5px;margin:0;padding:0!important;text-align:left;visibility:hidden;width:0"></th></tr></tbody></table></th>
